{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女神IU今年6月向首爾中央地方法院提出損害賠償訴訟，控告一名身分不明的網民，利用國際社交網帳號涉嫌散播不實內容，對方自去年3月至10月，至少發布52則與IU相關的貼文，內容涉誹謗IU抄襲等虛假內容，對IU名譽造成損害。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:21:08.736027+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:05:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:29.796943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:29.796943+00:00","content_hash":"3e0ce46bbc5fba66bf0b98f97f91d879440ac1330dc562819bfd03e877fbae71","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}